        rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Ch. VII — tissue cells as hexagons / froth vs. human corneal endothelium (Pass 2: segmented specimen, sweep, controls, statistics) — Code-to-model traceability: 80/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Module docstring maps C1-C3 and steps 1-7 to Thompson pages and equations E1-E6; every function docstring names its law; math_kg code_locus/lean_locus pass the integrity and formula-alignment gates; Fig. 125 crop boxes carry their derivation comment. Segmentation hyper-parameters (blueness 40, min contact 4 px, min_distance) are documented but not derived from the image." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
